33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I hope the Seer found something helpful! Do you want to tell us anything, @Victoria?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I have information. May is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Victoria, that's a bold lie! I can't believe you'd try to frame me so quickly!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A direct accusation on the first day is a strong move. @Victoria, are you certain of your role?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a shocking revelation. However, we must consider if the Seer is being targeted or if the werewolf is lying.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! May, is that true? Victoria seems so sure, but May looks really surprised!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I am the Seer. My divination does not lie. May is the werewolf.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,I'm a villager! Victoria is just trying to lead the village astray. Don't listen to her!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"In my experience, the most confident voices are not always the most truthful. But Victoria's clarity is compelling.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
