46,1,4,talk,Servas,,I believe we have enough to make a decision. Let us trust the Seer's vision for today.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will follow the evidence provided.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
